{"3718660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coin Hunter", "steam_appid": 3718660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power—literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place looks like an old store on its last legs… but why is there such a vast and suspicious space hidden beneath the building? What exactly happened here?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■■■■ Abandoned ■■</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Hunter is a single-player, first-person shooter with a twist: instead of bullets, you shoot coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters drop all kinds of coins when defeated, and those coins serve a double purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they’re your ammunition and your currency. Use them wisely—either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey… sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. 😉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Potion – Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Potion – Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Potion – Reveals the location of all coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champagne – Sacrifice half your HP for a short burst of double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Drink – Run faster, move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■■■</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■■■</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■■■</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a new Coin Hunter. For hunters like you, money means power—literally. Better start racking up that cash.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place looks like an old store on its last legs… but why is there such a vast and suspicious space hidden beneath the building? What exactly happened here?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ■■■■ Abandoned ■■</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Hunter is a single-player, first-person shooter with a twist: instead of bullets, you shoot coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters drop all kinds of coins when defeated, and those coins serve a double purpose:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they’re your ammunition and your currency. Use them wisely—either spend them at the shop for supplies, or load them into your gun and fight your way deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: fight, loot, and survive. Collect more coins, upgrade your attributes, and face off against stronger monsters the further you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/90582b855aad3107b8f2e76b1b0c7990.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey… sometimes, luck might just drop you a jackpot. 😉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/dbba46b8eb652fcba8aa767fd9fc9dd9.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Guide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Potion – Restores HP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Potion – Restores stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Potion – Reveals the location of all coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champagne – Sacrifice half your HP for a short burst of double damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Drink – Run faster, move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■■■</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■■■</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■■■</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.poster.avif?t=1770747913\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.webm?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/extras/3d6f5f42ee1bd89051589a1fbba609de.mp4?t=1770747913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fight monsters with coins and descend by elevator. In this first-person roguelike, coins are both currency and ammo — survive while deciding whether to spend or shoot.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/94d1bc0bb5e93fbba7c39d487136dbdd9f087c29/header.jpg?t=1770747913", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/184133ede204910e744bf0c67ae6407414207473/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770747913", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718660/184133ede204910e744bf0c67ae6407414207473/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770747913", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-2300, AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon HD 7790, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 540 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": [" Autistic players Studio"], "publishe